Package: ggaltdata
Title: Data-Driven Alternative Text and Data Tables for 'ggplot2' Charts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Federico", "Ninivaggi", email = "fninivdevelopment@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates alternative text that states what a 'ggplot2' chart
    shows (highest and lowest values, rankings, trends, gaps between groups,
    overlap of intervals), a long description and the data table, computed
    from the data of the chart itself. Output for 'R Markdown', 'Quarto',
    'Word', saved images and 'Shiny', in English and Italian.
